      "canonicalEntityId": "cmsumr74z003rodfppy1l9peb",
      "proposition": "El arte conceptual es un tipo de arte para el cual la idea o concepto detrás de la obra es más importante que el objeto artístico final.",
      "supportQuote": "Conceptual art is art for which the idea (or concept) behind the work is more important than the finished art object.",
      "source": {
        "sourceId": "cmt4kt35k0008vwfpbo8yt2e3",
        "locator": "paragraph-1",
